      "versionNonce": 2044747939,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1782074404882,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question 3:\nWhat if multiple users are trying to borrow the same book\ncopy at the same time?\n\nAnswer:\n\nThis is a concurrency problem.\n\nThe main goal is to make sure there is no double booking.\n\nApproach:\n\n1. The borrow operation should run inside a database\ntransaction.\n\n2. The system should lock the specific book_copy row\nusing copy_id.\n\n3. The system should check the current status.\n\n   If copy_status = 'AVAILABLE':\n   - insert borrow transaction\n   - update copy_status = 'BORROWED'\n   - commit\n\n   If copy_status = 'BORROWED':\n   - reject the request\n   - do not create another borrow record\n\n4. This makes the operation atomic.\n\nAtomic means either the full borrow operation succeeds,\nor nothing is changed.\n\nThis ensures consistency even when many users are using\nthe system at the same time.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ANonTePj0YglvkMW2pVyZ",
      "originalText": "Question 3:\nWhat if multiple users are trying to borrow the same book copy at the same time?\n\nAnswer:\n\nThis is a concurrency problem.\n\nThe main goal is to make sure there is no double booking.\n\nApproach:\n\n1. The borrow operation should run inside a database transaction.\n\n2. The system should lock the specific book_copy row using copy_id.\n\n3. The system should check the current status.\n\n   If copy_status = 'AVAILABLE':\n   - insert borrow transaction\n   - update copy_status = 'BORROWED'\n   - commit\n\n   If copy_status = 'BORROWED':\n   - reject the request\n   - do not create another borrow record\n\n4. This makes the operation atomic.\n\nAtomic means either the full borrow operation succeeds, or nothing is changed.\n\nThis ensures consistency even when many users are using the system at the same time.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
